dy  can remember the crash ship the AAA guns  on the hill and we knew it was kind of  an easy transition over to infinite  Warfare's theater of war and layers can  out boost jump up to the lookout and  counter snipers with close range  engagements but Raven the Redwoods is a  trip back to the 1990s to a place that  is such a stark contrast from what we  did in zombies in space land I think  players are in for real surprise we made  them really comfortable in space land by  opening up lanes making it bright and  colorful this is really a horror film  brought to life in a video game form  it's going to blow people's minds after  getting sucked out of Tommy's in space  land our four characters appear in a  cabin they wake up kind of groggy they  kind of realize that there may be in the  90s now as you explore outside of the  cabin find out that you're actually in a  abandoned camp that's been kind of taken  over by a few hundred raver kids that  are throwing up an all-night rave party  in the middle of the woods the level has  this dark foreboding kind of spooky vibe  and then the world comes alive  [Music]  there's new weaponry there's new fate  and fortune cards coming new traps  within the map our cast of characters  are getting a whole new wardrobe change  we're gonna introduce a new character  named the slasher there's so much more  to tell  we can't wait for people to get a chance  to experience what it's like to be in  rave in the redwoods people are in for a  real treat  all the devs here at Infinity Ward  cannot wait for our fans to get their  hands on the new cons the weapons the  quests there's so much going into it  fans are going to be super excited Call  of Duty infinite warfare DLC one pack  will be available January 31st first on  ps4 get the season pass and receive $20  of bonus content
 

